<title>USA: Provident files $900 mln shelf registration.</title>
<headline>Provident files $900 mln shelf registration.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Provident Cos Inc on Friday filed a shelf registration with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to sell up to $900 million in debt securities, preferred and common stock, and warrants.</p>
</text>
